		{"id":"b28948f2b758c53b","type":"text","text":"导数的定义","x":-280,"y":-189,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"81950b930b5f3337","type":"text","text":"$lim_{h->0} \\frac{f(x0+h)-f(x0)}{h}$  ","x":30,"y":-339,"width":170,"height":60,"color":"#1aa4e0"},
		{"id":"d0d5d3307e9c85de","type":"text","text":"*想要表示一种趋近*","x":-35,"y":-403,"width":130,"height":50},
		{"id":"a7528d2e167d4c6c","type":"text","text":"变化率、切线斜率","x":119,"y":-129,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"736d9859a4a6be44","type":"text","text":"可以看出极值点与拐点许多结论非常相似。\n俩者还有以下结论：\n- 可导点不同时为极值点和拐点\n- 不可导点可同时为极值点和拐点![](assets/Pasted%20image%2020260129102045.png)","x":-820,"y":1020,"width":250,"height":336},
		{"id":"038412d9738bfd3a","type":"text","text":"对于 $(x-a)^ng (x)$ \n*   **若 $n$ 为偶数** $\\rightarrow$ **a 为极值点**\n*   **若 $n$ 为奇数** $\\rightarrow$ **拐点**。\n    *   *原理：奇次幂 $x^3, x^5$ 会穿过切线，发生变号。*","x":-820,"y":1389,"width":250,"height":211},
		{"id":"22679e67777d103a","type":"text","text":"也有可能 $f' (x) 不存在$","x":249,"y":1058,"width":250,"height":68},
		{"id":"b02a86fb64cb7722","type":"text","text":"$f' (x0)=0$  则必能推出定义","x":-43,"y":1028,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ad4dc4800332d67c","type":"text","text":"在该点连续（*排除了间断的情况*）\n在该点**去心左右领域**导数异号，视情况可判为极大或极小","x":-363,"y":1331,"width":268,"height":114},
		{"id":"57b8a3f90aa708c7","type":"text","text":"极值","x":-329,"y":884,"width":131,"height":60},
		{"id":"8cd47499555e975a","type":"text","text":"判别类型","x":-95,"y":1218,"width":132,"height":50},
		{"id":"07a0e456cc243474","type":"text","text":"几何直觉：**函数值**接近的速度比横轴点接近速度更快或相等","x":244,"y":-417,"width":242,"height":78},
		{"id":"7d165f376483c596","type":"text","text":"可导必连续，连续不一定可导","x":280,"y":-249,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"21d9812a0c8636d4","type":"text","text":"## 例 4.3（复合函数求导）\n![](../../../../../assets/image/微分概念与计算--张宇基础30讲-1766647672307.jpeg)\n当如本题求导数，而不是导函数或者什么函数之类时，不必写表达式","x":814,"y":-434,"width":870,"height":251},
		{"id":"935233905c82b867","type":"text","text":"## 例 4.7（反函数二阶导公式推导）\n纯粹是考公式\n\n![](../../../../../assets/image/微分概念与计算--张宇基础30讲-1766669219529.jpeg)\n","x":817,"y":-120,"width":870,"height":331},
		{"id":"3a383bc6d7b72f77","type":"text","text":"**定义：若存在x0 某领域内，任意点 x，都有 f(x)<=f(x0) 或 f(x)>=f(x0)，则 x0 为函数极点**。   ","x":-3,"y":740,"width":280,"height":112,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e78e532c685c827a","type":"text","text":"# 换个反向\n已知是极大值点，推导出的结论是 $f''(x) \\le 0$，多了个等号","x":374,"y":1223,"width":250,"height":165},
		{"id":"788449dcc8c21346","type":"text","text":"微分的定义","x":-280,"y":57,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"765b0ef4ffc2cae7","type":"text","text":"$\\Delta y = f'(x) \\Delta x + o(\\Delta x)$","x":75,"y":90,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#1983e6"},
		{"id":"9769dd17e7ad3c2c","type":"text","text":"面积的增量：线性增量+边角料\n![](assets/Pasted%20image%2020260309105458.png)","x":-280,"y":270,"width":435,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"afaa6757a9b5f42c","type":"text","text":"以直代曲：线性增量+误差\n\n![](../../../../../assets/image/书籍对齐-1765769453466.jpeg)","x":197,"y":270,"width":353,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c8530204be7a4d48","type":"text","text":"\n## 4.19（计算）\n![](../../../../../assets/image/微概计--张宇基础30讲-1767578093312.jpeg)\n","x":880,"y":554,"width":614,"height":240},
		{"id":"0df6d28fa564bff3","type":"text","text":"## 例 4.18（泰勒公式）\n![](../../../../../assets/image/微概计--张宇基础30讲-1767577587195.jpeg)\n","x":880,"y":334,"width":744,"height":187},
		{"id":"d33ac0d0eaf2fdf8","type":"text","text":"![](assets/Pasted%20image%2020260119192401.png)\n\n\n\n![](../../../../../assets/image/02微概计--张宇基础30讲-1767949283201.jpeg)","x":1840,"y":-386,"width":886,"height":500},
		{"id":"478110bca3a49036","type":"text","text":"该点可导，且导数为 0.\n判断二阶导\n- 二阶导小于 0 为极大值\n- 二阶导大于 0 为极小值","x":57,"y":1378,"width":257,"height":134},
		{"id":"b8bf57cd8f82b404","type":"text","text":"![](assets/Pasted%20image%2020260119192425.png)","x":1840,"y":154,"width":886,"height":160},
		{"id":"367bd32c278a9330","type":"text","text":"- 故而常数就处处是极值\n- 间断点也有可能是极值（根据定义来看，完全不影响）","x":374,"y":740,"width":259,"height":204,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5fc954118356d58f","type":"text","text":"# 计算技巧\n- **一般用 ln 时，是指数部分为未知数！幂函数多项式指数部分是常数，显然直接求导**\n- 判断其有斜渐近线？就是直接除以 x 试一试的\n- ","x":1062,"y":1080,"width":250,"height":207},
		{"id":"f75054671531d1e0","type":"text","text":"## 1000 题 4\n![](../../../../../assets/image/03微几何-1768832696916.jpeg)\n","x":1087,"y":1566,"width":722,"height":141},
		{"id":"0bd0b262a87cb103","type":"text","text":"# 1000 题\n![](../../../../../assets/image/03微几何-1768832609926.jpeg)\n","x":1080,"y":1400,"width":729,"height":127},
		{"id":"d9b3b5596439b0a7","type":"text","text":"凹凸性的定义：a 图凹，b 图凸，我觉得没必要记公式，图很熟就 ok\n![](assets/Pasted%20image%2020260119201743.png)\n","x":-210,"y":1660,"width":524,"height":309},
		{"id":"c30ac0e19ecc18b0","type":"text","text":"二阶导大于 0 图像凹，显然因为切线斜率是单调递增的 ","x":430,"y":1754,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e3c5fe6b6d0abd87","type":"text","text":"拐点的定义：凹凸曲线的分界处。是 (x0, y0)","x":-198,"y":2054,"width":250,"height":100},
		{"id":"9858c69b0da95696","type":"text","text":"判别","x":-52,"y":2360,"width":105,"height":50},
		{"id":"e417f0b6c25589b8","type":"text","text":"在该点连续（*排除了间断的情况*）\n在该点**去心左右领域** **二阶导数**异号","x":-210,"y":2537,"width":262,"height":121},
		{"id":"6107525bbaf50354","type":"text","text":"![](assets/Pasted%20image%2020260119203106.png)","x":-430,"y":2880,"width":704,"height":191,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"84619c01c7830cf4","type":"text","text":"二阶导等于 0","x":156,"y":2096,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9c129589aa53b938","type":"text","text":"**不能推过去！也有可能不存在二阶导**","x":-25,"y":2214,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d75c4ce6152a9b25","type":"text","text":"![](assets/Pasted%20image%2020260202122122.png)","x":-940,"y":3280,"width":546,"height":180},
		{"id":"9c4157766b1a48bb","type":"text","text":"该点三阶可导，且二阶导数为 0.\n三阶导数不等于 0","x":225,"y":2608,"width":248,"height":100}
